    "title": "Are Costco, Aldi, Walmart open today on Easter Sunday? Illinois hours",
    "text": "April 5, 2026, 5:04 a.m. CTNot everyone celebrates Easter Sunday, but many will need to run last-minute errands to grab snacks, paper towels or the odd iced coffee.But how will the holiday affect store hours in Illinois? Here's a look at which stores are expected to be open and closed.As always, these are general rules. Residents should check with their local stores, as there are always exceptions.Is Aldi open on Easter Sunday?Aldi stores will be closed on Easter Sunday.Is Best Buy open on Easter Sunday?Best Buy stores are generally expected to be closed on Easter Sunday.Is Costco closed on Easter Sunday?Costco warehouses will be closed on Easter Sunday.Is CVS closed on Easter Sunday?CVS stores will generally be open, though the pharmacy is expected to be closed for Easter.Is IKEA closed on Easter Sunday?IKEA stores will be open, but with limited hours. Stores in Illinois will close early at 6 p.m.Is Starbucks open on Easter Sunday?Starbucks stores will generally be open on Sunday.Is Target open on Easter Sunday?Target stores will be closed on Easter Sunday.Is TJ Maxx closed on Easter Sunday?T.J. Maxx stores will be closed Easter Sunday.Is Trader Joe's open on Easter Sunday?Trader Joe's stores will be open Easter Sunday.Is Walmart closed on Easter Sunday?Walmart stores will be open on Sunday.Is Walgreens closed on Easter Sunday?Walgreens stores will be open on Easter Sunday, but the pharmacies will generally be closed.",
